<title>CHINA: CHUNG TAI YEAR NET RISES 40.8 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>CHUNG TAI YEAR NET RISES 40.8 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  11.8   vs 8.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   2.1    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   35.43  vs 25.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		    328.91 vs 325.30</p>
<p>    Company name		Chung Tai Printing Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 September 9-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  September 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Chung Tai Printing produces labels and packaging.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.3 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.2 cents) vs 3.2 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
